The OpenStreetMap data in this folder (raw/osm.pbf, and the files in build/
that come from it) is a Derivative Database of OpenStreetMap.

© OpenStreetMap contributors.

It is available under the Open Database License 1.0 (ODbL):
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

The corrections in overrides.json are a part of this Derivative Database, and
are also under the ODbL 1.0.

The height data (raw/dem.tif, and the height files in build/height/) comes from
the Copernicus DEM GLO-30:

produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence
and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and
ESA; all rights reserved.

The organisations in charge of the Copernicus programme by law or by delegation
do not incur any liability for any use of the Copernicus WorldDEM-30.
